#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "In the new repository `livesAt` goes (absent means it sits at the root of `repository`) and `platform.ts` points at where the platform now is. The host consumes it as a submodule if it imports its code, or a subscription if it only reads its content, pinned to a commit while staging. Additive: the host keeps its copy."
msgstr ""

