#: processes/kg/sub-kg-lifecycle.bpmn:145
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Move what is generic into the harness below before the seam is closed, and consolidate what the sub-KG needs into the harness it instantiates. Wrong-direction edges hide in declarations and data as well as imports: run check:import-direction, check:reference-direction and check:process-bindings. Learned from stages A-D of bean n3ni (#1768, #1782, #1783, #1795)."
msgstr ""

